# 104-demo-view.lua

Draws each record made by `103-demo-sections.lua` as lines of text.  One
function per scene, same names as the scenes, each taking that scene's
record and giving a list of string; `tally` also takes the
`101-show-options` module and draws with its `summary_lines`, so the demo
and `scripts/tally-options` print the same table.  Loaded with
`require("104-demo-view")`.

| function | takes | gives |
|---|---|---|
| `flat(record)` | flat record | the `ls rooms/` and `find rooms -type f` listings, the tree, each room's four files |
| `people(record)` | people record | top rooms and links per contact, before and after the girlfriend joins ritz |
| `collision(record)` | collision record | coder's links under each link-collision variant |
| `reader(record)` | reader record | per disclosure mode: what each room tells the reader about its parent, and the trees drawn |
| `log(record)` | log record | per shape: append answers, file order, screen order, the raw log, bulk sizes and timings; a size summary |
| `edits(record)` | edits record | per edit rule: each attempt's answer or refusal, then the screen |
| `split(record)` | split record | per shape: room rows (people, messages, list) before and after, the split marker, where the old id now leads, p2's folders and p3's links |
| `tally(record, show)` | tally record, module | the tally summary |
